<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "escapescape.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>That time, in the end, we left <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> behind.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There was no way we could take our daughter to a place where we might commit murder.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
We met <STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu-san</STYLE>, and sure enough, she asked us to kill the two kids bullying <STYLE ID="3">Haruka-chan</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And then that horrifying incident...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
At the same time, it meant <STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu-san</STYLE> now had a hold over us.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
After that, at every memorial service, there were orders to kill from <STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu-san</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu-san</STYLE> also told us not to move away from Motoki-cho.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If we ever tried to move, the distrust of <STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu-san</STYLE>'s 'someone I can trust' would be <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="あお">stoked</STYLE> as well.<PG>
If we ended up out of contact with <STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu-san</STYLE>, we'd make an enemy of the Arata settlement.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
To let <STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu-san</STYLE> know where we were on a regular basis, we had <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="3">Haruka-chan</STYLE> write letters to each other.<PG>
Eventually, <STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu-san</STYLE> came back to Motoki-cho.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Apparently people around <STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu-san</STYLE>'s family found them creepy, and they couldn't stay in Megasawa City anymore.<PG>
When I looked into it, Megasawa City had once been a religious city, just as <STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu-san</STYLE> had said.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So quite a few people truly believed it was a case of being spirited away, and things had apparently gone far beyond bullying at school.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Coming back to Motoki-cho can't have been what <STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu-san</STYLE> wanted, either, but it must have been convenient for keeping watch on our movements.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\居間.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―And then, that day came.<PG>
{PLAYSND "日没廃校.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="5">"A bug in the phones?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"For </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"What on earth for..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s too kind, it seems, so she's easy to bully... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> or someone else could turn against </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> any time. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">So I need to be able to keep watch on </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and the others at all times. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Protecting your child is only natural for a mother, isn't it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Anger welled up in me, but <STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu-san</STYLE> was no longer someone you could talk sense to.<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Then you could just install a bugging app, couldn't you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"What are you saying? If we did that, there's no telling when </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> might find out about the app. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s friend, that girl named </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">That girl</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> only has to get the least bit suspicious, and it'll come out. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">All it needs is a function that sends audio data, nothing more. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Or are you going to make me a special app from scratch now?"</STYLE><PG>
Given how the phones my company makes are built, I could probably fit a bug inside and send the audio out over the network.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But I didn't have the skills to make software, like an app.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Let me see... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Have it done by April 3, please. If they're presents for moving up a year, it'll seem natural."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"That's only a week from now... Counting the time for testing, two of them is impossible."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Oh, is that so... Then the bug only needs to go in </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">And please get a phone for that girl </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> as well. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, that girl, seems to be very </STYLE><STYLE ID="7" RUBY="おうせい">curious</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, and I want to pull her interest away from </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s phone, even a little. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">If she has the same thing, that takes care of it."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With that, <STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu-san</STYLE> set down an envelope with something inside.
{PLAYSND "SE\paper-round1_0.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Well, I'll be going. Let me know when it's ready."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
With those words, <STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu-san</STYLE> left the room.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\paper-round1_0.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
Inside the envelope was 300,000 yen in cash.<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Damn...!"</STYLE>
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\テーブル叩く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I brought my fist down on the envelope.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What we did 10 years ago was a mistake after all! Things are only getting worse and worse!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If this keeps escalating, what will she come out with next?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "togisuma.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"I see... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">So that's what she said..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\居間.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
That night, I told <STYLE ID="8">Akane</STYLE> about what <STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu-san</STYLE> had asked of me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Maybe <STYLE ID="8">Akane</STYLE>'s senses had gone numb as well. She barely reacted.<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> is the reason I've put up with it, but I can't take any more...! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　It's not just about how I feel. If this goes on, something even more horrible is going to happen...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"You're... right."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Again, <STYLE ID="8">Akane</STYLE> barely reacted.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Ever since 10 years ago, things between <STYLE ID="8">Akane</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu-san</STYLE> hadn't seemed very good to me.<PG>
We've been used however <STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu-san</STYLE> pleases.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She holds <STYLE ID="3">Haruka-chan</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> hostage and makes us commit murder.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Ryoji-kun</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, what do you want to do?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then again, it wasn't as if I had a good plan.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And refusing <STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu-san</STYLE>'s orders was, as they say, out of the question.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\作業机.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
From the next day on, when I got home from work, I set to work putting a bug in the phone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was my first time doing that kind of work, but once I tried, it wasn't all that hard.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With a small bug fitted in the phone, it could send audio over the network, and the phone could supply the bug with power as well.<PG>
But there was one big problem.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's a technical matter, but if you attach an external device like this, naturally the software side has to support it, too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The guys in the software department wouldn't have planned for anything this far outside the spec, so new device drivers and the like would have to be prepared.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Unfortunately, I didn't have the skill to make them.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\手直し・追加\会議室.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"―Hey, Section Chief Kondo."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"What is it, <STYLE ID="5">Section Chief Kogori</STYLE>?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
After a meeting one day ended, I called out to the section chief of the software department.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Um... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Say we built an off-the-shelf bug into the next model. How long would it take the software side to support it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"A bug...? 
{PAUSE ""}
　Ha ha ha! <STYLE ID="5">Section Chief Kogori</STYLE>, that's another interesting project from you!"<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Well, uh... I just thought if you could record audio data to an outside server, there might be demand for it as a service..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Hmm... I see... 
{PAUSE ""}
But in that case, couldn't you just take one of the bugging apps out there, rename it 'Recording App' or something, and release it? 
{PAUSE ""}
　If you go to the trouble of building something like that, counting the testing, it'll take more than a month! Ha ha ha!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Ha... ha ha ha... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Yeah, of course..."</STYLE><PG>
"Besides, even if you can't send the audio in real time, wouldn't it be simpler to record the audio data on the phone and send it off by email?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Real-time sending is impossible...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"That's right. Whether you need that or not makes all the difference!"<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu-san</STYLE> probably wouldn't be satisfied unless she could hear the audio in real time.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
3 days left until the deadline.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Should I explain the situation to <STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu-san</STYLE> and ask for more time...<PG>
Even so, for an engineer, nothing could be more humiliating.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Phones made to build a richer society, being used for something like this...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It seemed my patience, too, was about at its limit.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Our family is being held hostage.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If we could leave Motoki-cho―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If we could get <STYLE ID="3">Haruka-chan</STYLE> back―<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
In that case... what I can do is...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "日没廃校.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\居間.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ青入.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "C" "100" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬腰に手バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Just what I'd expect from </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Ryoji-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">. I can't believe how clearly it comes through."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
On April 3, <STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu-san</STYLE> seemed pleased with the bugged phone she had received.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just as she'd asked, she could listen to the bugged audio in real time.<BR>
The model <STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu-san</STYLE> had specified could also be checked from other phones, so you could tell where your child was.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With this, both their whereabouts and their conversations were laid bare.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"But if she turns the GPS off, I won't know where she is, will I?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, your phone can control the settings remotely. Only on </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">'s, though."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Is that remote control an app? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　It's on this phone, and it's not something </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> could find out about, is it?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"On </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">'s end, I made it a hidden app."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hold on, then there's no telling when it'll be found out. That's why I said no bugging app, put the bug itself in―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Sorry, but with this deadline, this is the best I can do."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"I see... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">But if there's any problem, I'll have you modify it."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"............"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1,000,アイテム1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Heh! Some development-department section chief I am!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\居間.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Ryoji-kun</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, that's enough now..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That night, I was drowning my sorrows.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Some parent I am! Some engineer!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
All I'm doing is being an accomplice to a crime!<PG>
Then something rose from the pit of my stomach into my mouth.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内早歩き.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "人物1,000" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\トイレ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\トイレ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I rushed into the bathroom and spewed <STYLE ID="9" RUBY="としゃぶつ">vomit</STYLE>, still reeking of alcohol, into the toilet bowl.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
